# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restricted source text — LOCAL ONLY (see docs/DATA_ACCESS.md)
#
# The Bible text captured from bible.com (THADBSI © Bible Society of India,
# NIV © Biblica) has no established redistribution permission, so the
# verse-text artifacts are never committed here. Metadata, audit hashes,
# manifests, reports, checksums and code ARE committed.
#
# Remove these entries only after written permission is recorded in
# LICENSE_NOTES.md and metadata/sources.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/normalized/
data/aligned/*.jsonl
data/aligned/splits/*.jsonl

# Rejected/scrapped corpus drops and local build scratch
local_only/
*.local.jsonl

# Console captures from collection runs (logs/*.log are the record of truth)
logs/*.out
